# AssetLoader API

## Module Location
`03__Src__AppModules/03__CommonUtils/CommonUtils__AssetLoader__.js`

## Initialization
```javascript
// AssetLoader is initialized automatically by AppCore__Main__.js
await window.NaProjectAdmin.AssetLoader.initialise(appConfig);
```

## Usage in Modules

### Get Common Asset URL
```javascript
const assetLoader = window.NaProjectAdmin.AssetLoader;

// Get font URL
const fontUrl = assetLoader.getAssetUrl('FONTS', 'CommonFont-01__OpenSans__Regular__.ttf');
// Returns: https://www.noble-architecture.com/na-apps/01__Assets__NaApps__CommonAssets/NaApps__CommonFonts/CommonFont-01__OpenSans__Regular__.ttf

// Get graphic URL
const logoUrl = assetLoader.getAssetUrl('GRAPHICS', 'NaBrandGraphic__CompanyLogo__w2048xh500px__.png');
// Returns: https://www.noble-architecture.com/na-apps/01__Assets__NaApps__CommonAssets/NaApps__CommonGraphics/NaBrandGraphic__CompanyLogo__w2048xh500px__.png

// Get icon URL
const faviconUrl = assetLoader.getAssetUrl('ICONS', 'CommonIcon__NaFavicon__ICO-h32px.ico');
// Returns: https://www.noble-architecture.com/na-apps/01__Assets__NaApps__CommonAssets/NaApps__CommonIcons/CommonIcon__NaFavicon__ICO-h32px.ico
```

### Get Project-Specific Asset URL
```javascript
// Get project asset URL
const projectAssetUrl = assetLoader.getProjectAssetUrl('JS01', '26', '10__ProjectAdmin__AppContent/ProjectAdmin__ProjectConfig__.json');
// Returns: https://www.noble-architecture.com/na-project-portal/26-Projects/JS01/10__ProjectAdmin__AppContent/ProjectAdmin__ProjectConfig__.json
```

### Asset Categories
- `'FONTS'` - Font files in `NaApps__CommonFonts/`
- `'GRAPHICS'` - Images and logos in `NaApps__CommonGraphics/`
- `'ICONS'` - Favicons in `NaApps__CommonIcons/`

